Once you have the CAC and LTV numbers, the ideal narrative will focus on the **LTV:CAC ratio** (a ratio of 3:1 or higher is generally considered excellent). This will demonstrate to stakeholders that not only is your capital management efficient, but your growth engine is highly profitable and scalable.

If you can provide the sales/marketing spend, customer counts, and churn data, I'd be happy to run the calculations and draft the exact narrative for your materials!

